    "chunk_text": "Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t leofeno\u00f0 \u00e6gelno\u00f0es sunu \u00e6t korstune h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht hine & his Crist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre awende. Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00c6gelsige \u00e6t Linncume h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht Wilsige his sunu ut \u00e6t Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6gelsige byttices sunu h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht hildesige his sunu ut \u00e6t Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t godwig se bucca h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht leofgife \u00fea d\u00e6gean \u00e6t nor\u00f0stoke & Crist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis \u00e6fre awende. Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisse cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lsige abbot h\u00e6f\u00f0 gefreod godwine bace \u00e6t stantune for hine & Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00f0issere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lfwig se red h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht hine sylfne ut \u00e6t \u00e6lfsige abbod & \u00dear is to gewitnes eall se hired on ba\u00f0an. Crist hine ablende \u00fee \u00feis gewrit awende. Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t edric \u00e6t fordan h\u00e6f\u00f0 geboht s\u00e6gyfu his dohtor \u00e6t \u00e6lfsige Her swutela\u00f0 on \u00feisses cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lfric scot & \u00e6gelric scot synd gefreod for \u00e6lsiges abbodes \u00deis is gedon on ealles hiredes gewitness. Her swutala\u00f0 on \u00feissere cristes bec \u00fe\u00e6t siwine leofwies sunu \u00e6t lincumbe hafu\u00fe geboht sydefl\u00e6de ut And herto is gewittnesse Godric ladda, & s\u00e6wold & his twegen",
